01:01:36.860 --> 01:01:39.620
And this is about the concept of boundary propagation.

01:01:39.820 --> 01:01:40.100
Okay.

01:01:40.420 --> 01:01:54.600
When a boundary in a system encounters a failure, swallowing the error like mapping a highly specific database timeout or a corrupted file error down to a generic failed string destroys the boundary's knowledge.

